  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Set in one of Castor Bay's most sought-after pockets, and positioned on a freehold 746m² site, this beautifully presented residence offers an exceptional coastal lifestyle, moments from stunning beaches, beautiful parks and a host of superb local amenities. Tucked away from the main road, the home enjoys a quiet and secluded setting, providing a peaceful retreat for families. For families, zoning for dual Westlake Boys and Girls' High Schools, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Campbells Bay Primary further enhances its appeal.\r\n\r\nSpread over three levels, this wonderfully spacious home offers five bedrooms, or four bedrooms plus a study, providing flexibility for modern family living. The master suite and second bedroom are positioned upstairs, capturing sweeping harbour views, while the main level features three further bedrooms, a family bathroom and generous living spaces. The kitchen sits at the heart of the home, creating a natural gathering place for everyday living and entertaining alike. The spacious living room and lounge provide the perfect setting for family gatherings or relaxing with a morning tea while taking in the spectacular sea views. Generous wrap-around decks extend the living outdoors and make the most of the elevated position, showcasing breathtaking views across the Hauraki Gulf to Rangitoto Island. A generous lawn offers plenty of space for children to play and enjoy the outdoors in a safe and private environment.\r\n\r\nThe home has been tastefully renovated throughout, including a dream kitchen and sleek contemporary bathrooms, all contributing to the fresh, welcoming feel of the property. A separate laundry and double internal-access garage complete the package.\r\n\r\nCastor Bay remains one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal communities. Beaches are close by, Centennial Park is on the doorstep for walks and weekend adventures, and Milford and Mairangi Bay are just minutes away for cafés, shopping and everyday conveniences. Golf enthusiasts will also appreciate the close proximity of Pupuke Golf Club, perfect for enjoying a relaxing round or practising their swing on a beautiful day. With the renovation already completed, you can simply move in and enjoy everything this special part of the North Shore has to offer.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
